    "body": "I don't think Gecko waits for service worker until processing the next event, the [PushService notifies the service worker](https://searchfox.org/mozilla-central/rev/67c9592293e8d9f143e6053c8cfd6b7723207e3c/dom/push/PushService.sys.mjs#685-698) and moves on for the next push message. There should be something that ties a PushEvent and showNotification.",
